From ce4f141c3f157159757957a4035c7fa8c64fb738 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 06:02:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ImsStack: debug menus without androidx.appcompat

The debug menus used AppCompatDelegate only for an action bar with an up
button, and the search dialog used appcompat's SearchView. Use the
platform ActionBar, android.widget.SearchView and the DeviceDefault
settings theme instead, and drop the appcompat dependency.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SByt7CZfKR6U4r1VS86tHS
